# {{PROJECT}}

## When to use

- The user asks whether {{PROJECT}} is installed or working.
- The user asks for its version.
- Another skill needs a cheap liveness check before running a longer flow.

## Commands

```bash
{{NPM_NAME}} --version
{{NPM_NAME}} ping --json
```

`ping --json` prints `{"ok": true, ...}`; a non-zero exit means the plugin is
not usable, so report the failure instead of retrying blindly.

## Limits

This skill only reports liveness. It does not deploy, install or configure the
plugin; say so when the user asks for those.
